(6502747, 966850, 19825, '<td valign="top">I am not exactly sure why I like this, but I really do. The partially out of frame subject and look of the trees give me a sense of excitement at being so close to a wild animal. I like the bluish tint and white bands. Had I taken this picture I might have passed over it. Had I attempted to process it for submission I would probably have botched it. In your hands, it turned out really well.</td>', 'I am not exactly sure why I like this, but I really do. The partially out of frame subject and look of the trees give me a sense of excitement at being so close to a wild animal. I like the bluish tint and white bands. Had I taken this picture I might have passed over it. Had I attempted to process it for submission I would probably have botched it. In your hands, it turned out really well.', '2011-08-12 13:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
