(6504196, 966625, 73942, '<td valign="top">great image of my 2nd fav city, this keeps the eye busy and the color pops against the grey sky</td>', 'great image of my 2nd fav city, this keeps the eye busy and the color pops against the grey sky', '2011-08-14 19:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6505225, 965988, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.  I am not sure how it fits with the challenge though.  To my liking, there also is a bit too much sky - trimming it down so that the sky portion is only about 1/3 of the frame works better visually, for me.  The sky has a few slightly blown areas that (what I assume is) the HDR treatment doesn''t hide.  The fog areas are fantastic.  ~7</td>', 'Beautiful photo.  I am not sure how it fits with the challenge though.  To my liking, there also is a bit too much sky - trimming it down so that the sky portion is only about 1/3 of the frame works better visually, for me.  The sky has a few slightly blown areas that (what I assume is) the HDR treatment doesn''t hide.  The fog areas are fantastic.  ~7', '2011-08-15 15:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6505227, 966646, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice play on the challenge topic.  Beautiful playful title also.  The blues are good, and the little bit of dusk salmon on the horizon makes the image pop.  I like the blur of the two people walking up the hill at far left ... it makes the whole scene less static.  ~7</td>', 'Nice play on the challenge topic.  Beautiful playful title also.  The blues are good, and the little bit of dusk salmon on the horizon makes the image pop.  I like the blur of the two people walking up the hill at far left ... it makes the whole scene less static.  ~7', '2011-08-15 15:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6505228, 966829, 5112, '<td valign="top">I love her expression, and I really like it that the whole outfit is sorta a climbing outfit (although the boots are more hiking boots I think).  Good control of light also.  What I don''t like so much is the rotation.  Yes, nothing in the challenge description said you couldn''t rotate, but in this case it just doesn''t make sense.  It simply feels like a gratuitous rotation, to fit the image into the challenge.  Sorry.  ~5</td>', 'I love her expression, and I really like it that the whole outfit is sorta a climbing outfit (although the boots are more hiking boots I think).  Good control of light also.  What I don''t like so much is the rotation.  Yes, nothing in the challenge description said you couldn''t rotate, but in this case it just doesn''t make sense.  It simply feels like a gratuitous rotation, to fit the image into the challenge.  Sorry.  ~5', '2011-08-15 15:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6505230, 966625, 5112, '<td valign="top">It does give the feeling of claustrophobia a bit, and it is a nice play on the topic for this challenge.  I find the clouds a bit strange ... they are blueish at left and at far right, but grey in the middle right.  The bright colours combined with the grey overall works well in this case.  ~8</td>', 'It does give the feeling of claustrophobia a bit, and it is a nice play on the topic for this challenge.  I find the clouds a bit strange ... they are blueish at left and at far right, but grey in the middle right.  The bright colours combined with the grey overall works well in this case.  ~8', '2011-08-15 15:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6505425, 966710, 128323, '<td valign="top">Very powerful shot of the Eiffel Tower--I would like to see the very top of the frame a little less darkened, but overall, great use of wide-angle and I love the silhouette of all the framework!  Well done!</td>', 'Very powerful shot of the Eiffel Tower--I would like to see the very top of the frame a little less darkened, but overall, great use of wide-angle and I love the silhouette of all the framework!  Well done!', '2011-08-15 19:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6505428, 966815, 128323, '<td valign="top">Awesome clouds...</td>', 'Awesome clouds...', '2011-08-15 19:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6505431, 966831, 128323, '<td valign="top">Wow... SELL THIS TO EVERY POSTCARD COMPANY YOU CAN FIND!  Amazing!  10</td>', 'Wow... SELL THIS TO EVERY POSTCARD COMPANY YOU CAN FIND!  Amazing!  10', '2011-08-15 19:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6505638, 966606, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful.  I like it just the way it is.  Doesn''t seem to be a great fit for the challenge topic, but most images in the challenge are not that strong on topic.  ~10</td>', 'Very beautiful.  I like it just the way it is.  Doesn''t seem to be a great fit for the challenge topic, but most images in the challenge are not that strong on topic.  ~10', '2011-08-16 00:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6505814, 966761, 93565, '<td valign="top">This is a bizarre image, and in some ways, I question how well this fits the criteria for the challenge, since he''s bending down anyway. Now, having read this far, I''m sure you''re thinking I''ll give you a low vote and not enjoy your efforts, but nothing could be further from the truth. I quite like it, for being such a curious shot, as well as being oddly drawing to me. Good job.</td>', 'This is a bizarre image, and in some ways, I question how well this fits the criteria for the challenge, since he''s bending down anyway. Now, having read this far, I''m sure you''re thinking I''ll give you a low vote and not enjoy your efforts, but nothing could be further from the truth. I quite like it, for being such a curious shot, as well as being oddly drawing to me. Good job.', '2011-08-16 05:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6505815, 966329, 93565, '<td valign="top">Regardless of whether the orientation is traditional or unconventional, I feel the choice should add something to the composition. I do not feel like your choice has added to things, mostly because the shot feels very unbalanced and incomplete. One last thing- since this is advanced editing, I personally would have eliminated the little bit of silk/hair below the dragonfly''s leg.</td>', 'Regardless of whether the orientation is traditional or unconventional, I feel the choice should add something to the composition. I do not feel like your choice has added to things, mostly because the shot feels very unbalanced and incomplete. One last thing- since this is advanced editing, I personally would have eliminated the little bit of silk/hair below the dragonfly''s leg.', '2011-08-16 05:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6505816, 966756, 93565, '<td valign="top">Pleasing application of a orientation reversal. While this shot would be somewhat abstract normally, by rotating it, the effect is dramatically increased. It almost looks like  a piece of copper with patina and scrapes/dents. Cool shot.</td>', 'Pleasing application of a orientation reversal. While this shot would be somewhat abstract normally, by rotating it, the effect is dramatically increased. It almost looks like  a piece of copper with patina and scrapes/dents. Cool shot.', '2011-08-16 05:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6505820, 966850, 93565, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot- the toning, particularly, has something about it that I enjoy.<br/>That border is killing me though.</td>', 'Interesting shot- the toning, particularly, has something about it that I enjoy.That border is killing me though.', '2011-08-16 05:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
