(6508891, 966816, 83313, '<td valign="top">You''re welcome. Glad you kept it in. Those comments are often what lets me know when a mediocre scoring shot actually nailed what I was after. Check out that commenter''s average! You didn''t pull a mediocre score because it was a mediocre shot, you pulled a mediocre score because as many hated it as loved it. Such is the usual fate of abstract photography. Keep it up.</td>', 'You''re welcome. Glad you kept it in. Those comments are often what lets me know when a mediocre scoring shot actually nailed what I was after. Check out that commenter''s average! You didn''t pull a mediocre score because it was a mediocre shot, you pulled a mediocre score because as many hated it as loved it. Such is the usual fate of abstract photography. Keep it up.', '2011-08-19 01:33:59.000000', NULL, 0),
