(6508904, 966841, 83313, '<td valign="top">I have no freaking clue how a shot like this ends up in mediocre-land! Reminded me a lot of this entry of my own, that scored in the same range, and I love both shots for the same reason.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=831420" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1116/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_831420.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1116/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_831420.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1116/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_831420.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I have no freaking clue how a shot like this ends up in mediocre-land! Reminded me a lot of this entry of my own, that scored in the same range, and I love both shots for the same reason.', '2011-08-19 01:39:22.000000', NULL, 0),
