(6509176, 965938, 117474, '<td valign="top">Is this done in the same sort of style as<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=535620" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/694/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_535620.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/694/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_535620.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/694/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_535620.jpg"/></a> <br/>?<br/>If it is could you describe how it was done, cause to be honest I found the descriptions really confusing! :-) <br/> <br/>Really nice shot, and great finish. Not surprised it finished in the top 20. Slightly surprised it didn''t finish in the top 10. I think the rotation must not have been to people''s tastes for this challenge.</td>', 'Is this done in the same sort of style as ?If it is could you describe how it was done, cause to be honest I found the descriptions really confusing! :-)  Really nice shot, and great finish. Not surprised it finished in the top 20. Slightly surprised it didn''t finish in the top 10. I think the rotation must not have been to people''s tastes for this challenge.', '2011-08-19 08:13:38.000000', NULL, 0),
