(6509370, 966831, 2333, '<td valign="top">Hey you!<br/>This was one of my two top picks of this challenge. I just love the composition, but what really made me fall for it is the beautiful processing. Great to see you on the front page!</td>', 'Hey you!This was one of my two top picks of this challenge. I just love the composition, but what really made me fall for it is the beautiful processing. Great to see you on the front page!', '2011-08-19 11:12:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(6509377, 966733, 135937, '<td valign="top">This is so elegant! Beautiful capture, Wendy.</td>', 'This is so elegant! Beautiful capture, Wendy.', '2011-08-19 11:15:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(6509380, 966710, 2333, '<td valign="top">Really, really like what you did with this. An out-of-the-box take on the challenge, and well executed. I love that you held detail in the tower, while shooting it contre-jour.<br/>My *only* niggle would be that I really would like to see the tower either precisely centered and vertical, or much more off-vertical. As it is, it looks like it was intended to be "precisely centered and vertical" but just missed.</td>', 'Really, really like what you did with this. An out-of-the-box take on the challenge, and well executed. I love that you held detail in the tower, while shooting it contre-jour.My *only* niggle would be that I really would like to see the tower either precisely centered and vertical, or much more off-vertical. As it is, it looks like it was intended to be "precisely centered and vertical" but just missed.', '2011-08-19 11:16:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(6509387, 966672, 67697, '<td valign="top">I really love how the waterspray looks here.  Very cool.<br/></td>', 'I really love how the waterspray looks here.  Very cool.', '2011-08-19 11:22:04.000000', NULL, 0),
