(6509642, 966773, 99263, '<td valign="top">Amanda this is really very very beautiful. Wonderful light and the trees are fantastic,especially that gnarled, bent over old tree and also the slanted tree on the left. Super processing that enhances this image even more. The fog rising from the barren earth like smoke adds something surreal and almost apocalyptic to the scene. It looks like a painting by one of the great Dutch masters. You really have a most amazing photograph here. Adding this one to my favorites.<br/> <br/>Ps. After reading Rian''s comment I just realized that the fog is in fact smoke and that what i am looking at is the aftermath of a veldfire. I echo Rian''s concern in hoping that the damage was not too severe.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-08-19 14:58:26.</i></td>', 'Amanda this is really very very beautiful. Wonderful light and the trees are fantastic,especially that gnarled, bent over old tree and also the slanted tree on the left. Super processing that enhances this image even more. The fog rising from the barren earth like smoke adds something surreal and almost apocalyptic to the scene. It looks like a painting by one of the great Dutch masters. You really have a most amazing photograph here. Adding this one to my favorites. Ps. After reading Rian''s comment I just realized that the fog is in fact smoke and that what i am looking at is the aftermath of a veldfire. I echo Rian''s concern in hoping that the damage was not too severe.', '2011-08-19 14:45:21.000000', '2011-08-19 15:58:26.000000', 0),
(6509647, 966773, 86218, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot. Wonderlike foto Amanda. Moes beter gedoen het. Baie mooi maar tragies en hoop daar is nie te veel skade nie</td>', 'Fantastic shot. Wonderlike foto Amanda. Moes beter gedoen het. Baie mooi maar tragies en hoop daar is nie te veel skade nie', '2011-08-19 14:54:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(6509715, 966773, 101668, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Rorschach:</b></div><hr/><i> Amanda this is really very very beautiful. Wonderful light and the trees are fantastic,especially that gnarled, bent over old tree and also the slanted tree on the left. Super processing that enhances this image even more. The fog rising from the barren earth like smoke adds something surreal and almost apocalyptic to the scene. It looks like a painting by one of the great Dutch masters. You really have a most amazing photograph here. Adding this one to my favorites.<br/> <br/>Ps. After reading Rian''s comment I just realized that the fog is in fact smoke and that what i am looking at is the aftermath of a veldfire. I echo Rian''s concern in hoping that the damage was not too severe. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Skade aan veld was nie te erg nie maar van die arbeiders het brandwonde opgedoen. Gelukkig het die wind nie getier nie. Dankie vir die mooi comment. Waardeer regtig.</td>', 'Originally posted by Rorschach: Amanda this is really very very beautiful. Wonderful light and the trees are fantastic,especially that gnarled, bent over old tree and also the slanted tree on the left. Super processing that enhances this image even more. The fog rising from the barren earth like smoke adds something surreal and almost apocalyptic to the scene. It looks like a painting by one of the great Dutch masters. You really have a most amazing photograph here. Adding this one to my favorites. Ps. After reading Rian''s comment I just realized that the fog is in fact smoke and that what i am looking at is the aftermath of a veldfire. I echo Rian''s concern in hoping that the damage was not too severe.  Skade aan veld was nie te erg nie maar van die arbeiders het brandwonde opgedoen. Gelukkig het die wind nie getier nie. Dankie vir die mooi comment. Waardeer regtig.', '2011-08-19 16:18:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6509718, 966773, 101668, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by RianBotes:</b></div><hr/><i> Fantastic shot. Wonderlike foto Amanda. Moes beter gedoen het. Baie mooi maar tragies en hoop daar is nie te veel skade nie </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Dankie Rian, het baie vinnig moes skiet want ons wou die beeste gaan wegkeer het voor die vuur. Dit was namiddag en die son agter die wolke. Ek het ''n klompie mooi fotos gekry van verskillende kante. Is Sept voorblad die een.</td>', 'Originally posted by RianBotes: Fantastic shot. Wonderlike foto Amanda. Moes beter gedoen het. Baie mooi maar tragies en hoop daar is nie te veel skade nie   Dankie Rian, het baie vinnig moes skiet want ons wou die beeste gaan wegkeer het voor die vuur. Dit was namiddag en die son agter die wolke. Ek het ''n klompie mooi fotos gekry van verskillende kante. Is Sept voorblad die een.', '2011-08-19 16:22:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(6509769, 966831, 44825, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful image. <br/> <br/>When I was a kid in the 60''s, we lived in Calgary and mum and dad would quite often take us camping in the wilds of Kananaskis. Loved it!<br/> <br/>Your shot brings back many happy memories - Thank you.</td>', 'What a beautiful image.  When I was a kid in the 60''s, we lived in Calgary and mum and dad would quite often take us camping in the wilds of Kananaskis. Loved it! Your shot brings back many happy memories - Thank you.', '2011-08-19 17:32:09.000000', NULL, 0),
